# Plugins stay out of source control

Just-in-time plugins are stored in local SQLite (`plugin_factory_releases`), not in git.

Never add to this repo or a PR: guest Go, skill files, compiled plugin binaries, plugin packages, or “sample” plugins.

David may override; that is rare. If a request would put plugin code or artifacts into pushed source, warn first and stop unless he confirms.
